coverage.*.xml

# ---- Editor backups / scratch ----
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej
*.tmp
*~

# ---- Agent scaffolding, working documents and local agent state ----
# Only what a clone needs to build, test, package and understand the product is tracked.
# Everything below is developer working material that stays in the local checkout:
#   .claude/ .superpowers/  agent harness state (user name, home-directory layout, caches)
#   openspec/               spec-driven change proposals and their build/test evidence
#   docs/plans/             implementation plans for past batches of work
#   docs/reviews/           point-in-time review transcripts
#   docs/diagrams/          generated architecture diagram plus the drawing tool's receipts
# scripts/package.ps1 removes the docs/ entries from the staging directory as well, so a
# package built from a local checkout matches one built from a fresh clone.
.claude/
.superpowers/
openspec/
docs/plans/
docs/reviews/
docs/diagrams/

# ---- IDE / OS ----
.idea/
.vscode/
.qtcreator/
.serial_mcp/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.swp

